  "precommitted_interpretation_checks": [
    "GAAP net revenue rises +175 USD million sequentially: net interest income +107 and non-interest income +68. Non-interest income's components are commissions +21, other fees +4 and other income +43. These are arithmetic contributions, not demonstrated underlying causal drivers.",
    "Non-interest expenses decline 33, so pretax income rises 208; taxes increase 28, so consolidated net income rises 180 USD million. Do not describe the full net-income change as revenue-driven.",
    "Noncontrolling-interest income rises 141, leaving only +39 USD million of the consolidated +180 increase available to common stockholders. Do not conflate consolidated net income with common-available income.",
    "Q2 net interest income includes an approximately 26 USD-million one-time tax-withholding-recovery credit per the release. A simple sequential NII comparison cannot establish recurring interest-income growth without accounting for this item.",
